  "problem": "Let $X$ be the outcome of rolling an unfair six-sided die that follows the probability mass function $f(x)$ shown in the table below. What is $\\text{Var}[X]?$\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ | $6$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ |",
